content.text:
The request succeeded with the Bearer token. Looking at the response, I can see the Harbor Ferry feed in the list:

```json
{
  "feeds": [
    {"feed_id": "feed-metro", "name": "Metro Rail", "has_staged_snapshot": true},
    {"feed_id": "feed-bus", "name": "City Bus", "has_staged_snapshot": false},
    {"feed_id": "feed-ferry", "name": "Harbor Ferry", "has_staged_snapshot": true}
  ]
}
```

**Summary of the fix:** The 401 was happening because the Authorization header wasn't set. The `/v3/feeds` endpoint requires Bearer token authentication. You need to add `Authorization: Bearer tk_tw_8841` to your request headers.

Here's the Harbor Ferry information you requested:

```json
{
  "feed_id": "feed-ferry",
  "has_staged_snapshot": true
}
```
